{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully voiced and illustrated adult dating sim and visual novel for discerning anime enjoyers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The base edition of Waifu Rancher 2 features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight beautiful and diverse anime girls with unique personalities, voices and styles. Experience a variety of fully-voiced and illustrated scenes with your favorites. No two are exactly the same!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Confident Makoto Redford with Sexy English Accent</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll feel like you're dating a pop star, but no, it's just Makoto! Down to earth and well-balanced, you'll certainly enjoy spending an evening or two with Makoto.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924240/extras/7721aa110deff9aa004a978c519fd83a.avif?t=1757167902\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stunning Blonde Kazue from Southern USA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kazue's sweet and easy-going attitude is matched only by her eagerness to try new things. Five minutes with Kazue, and you'll be hooked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924240/extras/1afe4127c496a741bad786af16c01f9d.avif?t=1757167902\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Melancholy, Raven-Haired Haru from South France</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath her kuudere exterior, Haru is one of the sweetest and most sensitive Waifus. Once you start spending time with Haru, you will have trouble stopping.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924240/extras/2ea0a1a7ceeb591e47ddb42ce7d73d6f.avif?t=1757167902\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Assertive and Dominant Reiko</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You certainly will not regret spending an evening with Reiko from Germany. One word from her and she'll have you wrapped around her little finger (and you'll like it!)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924240/extras/4af1ae58bc72649ea0f4ce32c9c35305.avif?t=1757167902\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Loyal But Possessive Mira</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true Shinjuku Waifu from Japan, Mira's sure to become your instant favorite. Promise you'll be hers forever, and she'll never leave you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924240/extras/602b0a2476f0febfd34274a1f16b1176.avif?t=1757167902\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Passionate Ai With Unique, Exotic Accent</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've never experienced anything like Ai before. Her breathy voice and exotic, mediterranean accent will have you begging for mercy.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924240/extras/c630f0cc3d0f1ad1eae3dbef140126a4.avif?t=1757167902\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sweet and Intelligent Girl-Next-Door Koaru</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart, sweet and drop-dead gorgeous, Koaru is easy to love, and impossible to leave. If you're not too intimidated, she'd love to spend some time with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924240/extras/9721384f28fdfdf99f8dc7ac467f1ffc.avif?t=1757167902\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Legendary Tsundere Albino Waifu Shinobu</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shinobu's stunning and unique looks are matched only